    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Like Chess. Playful Like Dominoes. Charming Like Carcassonne.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planks and Arrows</strong> is a charming <strong>puzzle adventure</strong> where movement is governed by <strong>directional arrows</strong> on the ground\u2014each one showing which direction you're allowed to move. Think of them like triangle-shaped signs pointing your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a new path? <strong>Place planks</strong> to extend or change your route and reach areas once out of reach. Every move matters in a world built on strategy and clever thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky characters, take on challenging <strong>quests</strong>, and uncover strange <strong>mysteries</strong>\u2014but above all\u2026 <strong>find your beloved pet bird, Henry</strong>! \ud83d\udc26</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Origins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally designed as a <strong>physical board game</strong>, <i>Planks and Arrows</i> began as a two-player match where players drew planks from a bag and built the playfield as they played\u2014racing to reach each other\u2019s base three times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The video game brings that concept to life with expanded gameplay, a world full of stories, and puzzles that challenge your spatial reasoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a whimsical world where everyone has a story\u2014and sometimes a challenge. Some characters will <strong>test your skills</strong> in a match, while others need your help completing tasks that require smart use of a limited number of planks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the middle of it all? A mystery: <strong>your bird Henry has gone missing.</strong> It's up to you to find out what happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Quick Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mood for pure strategy?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>offline matches</strong> against AI or with local friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge others online in casual or <strong>ranked</strong> games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart opponents by building better paths and anticipating their moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 20 planks drawn in random order, every match is a new puzzle waiting to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it your own:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite <strong>arena</strong> to battle in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how your <strong>planks</strong> look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your <strong>pawns</strong> to reflect your style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're exploring the story or climbing the leaderboard, Planks and arrows will offer you countless hours of strategic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u265f\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Like Chess. Playful Like Dominoes. Charming Like Carcassonne.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planks and Arrows</strong> is a charming <strong>puzzle adventure</strong> where movement is governed by <strong>directional arrows</strong> on the ground\u2014each one showing which direction you're allowed to move. Think of them like triangle-shaped signs pointing your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a new path? <strong>Place planks</strong> to extend or change your route and reach areas once out of reach. Every move matters in a world built on strategy and clever thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky characters, take on challenging <strong>quests</strong>, and uncover strange <strong>mysteries</strong>\u2014but above all\u2026 <strong>find your beloved pet bird, Henry</strong>! \ud83d\udc26</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Origins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally designed as a <strong>physical board game</strong>, <i>Planks and Arrows</i> began as a two-player match where players drew planks from a bag and built the playfield as they played\u2014racing to reach each other\u2019s base three times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The video game brings that concept to life with expanded gameplay, a world full of stories, and puzzles that challenge your spatial reasoning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a whimsical world where everyone has a story\u2014and sometimes a challenge. Some characters will <strong>test your skills</strong> in a match, while others need your help completing tasks that require smart use of a limited number of planks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And in the middle of it all? A mystery: <strong>your bird Henry has gone missing.</strong> It's up to you to find out what happened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Quick Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mood for pure strategy?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>offline matches</strong> against AI or with local friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge others online in casual or <strong>ranked</strong> games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart opponents by building better paths and anticipating their moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 20 planks drawn in random order, every match is a new puzzle waiting to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it your own:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite <strong>arena</strong> to battle in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change how your <strong>planks</strong> look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your <strong>pawns</strong> to reflect your style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're exploring the story or climbing the leaderboard, Planks and arrows will offer you countless hours of strategic play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
